WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:14.944
Ringo and Bot went into a spaceship.

2
00:00:14.945 --> 00:00:23.305
They blasted off.

3
00:00:23.306 --> 00:00:31.706
The spaceship flew through the galaxy.

4
00:00:31.707 --> 00:00:35.150
Suddenly Bot pointed to the map.

5
00:00:35.151 --> 00:00:41.888
"Fire Lake is below us," she said.

6
00:00:41.889 --> 00:00:47.808
Ringo looked down. "I just see black clouds."

7
00:00:47.809 --> 00:00:52.167
His eyes went wide. "Huh? Wait!

8
00:00:52.168 --> 00:00:56.226
Those clouds are from Mount Magma!"

9
00:00:56.227 --> 00:00:58.831
The sky got darker.

10
00:00:58.832 --> 00:01:01.550
Bot went to look too.

11
00:01:01.551 --> 00:01:09.935
"There's so much ash in the air!

12
00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:11.822
Hold on tight, Ringo.

13
00:01:11.823 --> 00:01:15.333
This will be a crash landing!"

14
00:01:15.334 --> 00:01:22.113
Shwoop! The spaceship dropped fast.

15
00:01:22.114 --> 00:01:24.162
Ringo closed his eyes.

16
00:01:24.163 --> 00:01:26.533
The spaceship hit something hard. Then—

17
00:01:26.534 --> 00:01:36.899
splash!

18
00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:40.678
"Bot, we landed in the lake!" Ringo said.

19
00:01:40.678 --> 00:01:46.776
But Bot didn't say anything.

20
00:01:46.777 --> 00:01:49.880
Her eyes were closed.

21
00:01:49.881 --> 00:01:56.719
"Oh no!" Ringo cried.

22
00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:01.588
Ringo checked Bot.

23
00:02:01.589 --> 00:02:06.192
"Think hard, Ringo," he said.

24
00:02:06.193 --> 00:02:08.774
"You know all about robots.

25
00:02:08.775 --> 00:02:13.623
What's wrong with Bot?"

26
00:02:13.624 --> 00:02:18.121
Ringo turned Bot around.

27
00:02:18.122 --> 00:02:20.499
"Oh! Whew!

28
00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:27.100
It's just her Power switch!"

29
00:02:27.101 --> 00:02:32.829
Whirr! Bot's eyes opened wide.

30
00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:36.172
"Where am I?" she asked.

31
00:02:36.173 --> 00:02:40.079
"We landed in the lake," Ringo said.

32
00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:42.812
"We need to find those birds."

33
00:02:42.813 --> 00:02:45.121
Rumble! Rumble!

34
00:02:45.122 --> 00:02:53.185
"Ahh!" Bot cried. "The volcano!"

